	-- Step 1: Zardeth of the Black Claw
	-- {npc:1435} Zardeth of the Black Claw · {object:2164} Slaughtered Lamb · {object:2101} Mage Quarter · {zone:1431} Duskwood · {zone:1437} Wetlands
	["At 25 {npc:1435}, in the cellar of the {object:2164} in the {object:2101} (beside the warlock trainers), wants two ingredients for a brew. Do it when your leveling takes you to {zone:1431} and the {zone:1437}."] = "25레벨에 {npc:1435}은(는) {object:2101}의 {object:2164} 지하실(흑마법사 교관 옆)에서 마법 재료 두 가지를 원합니다. 레벨업 동선이 {zone:1431}과 {zone:1437}을 지날 때 하세요.",

	-- Step 2: Tear of Tilloa
